{"text":"In previous instances, African states will stubbornly back the incumbent in different parties in conflict. Today, African states act in concert on many substantive issues adopting a common African position and negotiating as one. That for us is progress. We are beginning to see evidence of a progressive environment not merely in overall accountability, but also in the performance of the African economy and in the economic status of its people. The index of growth has been growing at over 5 percent over the past decade. A recent African Development Bank report measured the rise of the middle class in Africa, totaling 313 million out of 1 billion Africans.","words":[{"text":"In","start":0.0,"end":0.7},{"text":"previous","start":0.7,"end":1.34},{"text":"instances","start":1.34,"end":2.18,"punct":","},{"text":"African","start":3.32,"end":3.5},{"text":"states","start":3.5,"end":3.98},{"text":"will","start":3.98,"end":4.16},{"text":"stubbornly","start":4.16,"end":4.7},{"text":"back","start":4.7,"end":5.02},{"text":"the","start":5.02,"end":5.72},{"text":"incumbent","start":5.72,"end":6.1},{"text":"in","start":6.1,"end":6.36},{"text":"different","start":6.36,"end":6.6},{"text":"parties","start":6.6,"end":7.02},{"text":"in","start":7.02,"end":7.26},{"text":"conflict","start":7.26,"end":7.74,"punct":"."},{"text":"Today","start":8.9,"end":9.28,"punct":","},{"text":"African","start":10.62,"end":10.9},{"text":"states","start":10.9,"end":11.28},{"text":"act","start":11.28,"end":11.76},{"text":"in","start":11.76,"end":12.06},{"text":"concert","start":12.06,"end":12.6},{"text":"on","start":12.6,"end":12.86},{"text":"many","start":12.86,"end":13.12},{"text":"substantive","start":13.12,"end":13.7},{"text":"issues","start":13.7,"end":14.36},{"text":"adopting","start":14.36,"end":15.62},{"text":"a","start":15.62,"end":15.86},{"text":"common","start":15.86,"end":16.12},{"text":"African","start":16.12,"end":16.56},{"text":"position","start":16.56,"end":17.16},{"text":"and","star